id: full-power-super-saiyan-true-power-of-the-saiyan-race
name: True Power of the Saiyan Race
order: 12
slot: legendary
# (1) "Your stacks of Power are treated as if they are Battle Born stacks applied to your Wound Rolls for your effects".
stacksCountAs: power = battlebornwound
description: >
  You know beyond a shadow of a doubt that the classics are the best, and you rock those golden flames and green eyes with effortless swagger.
text: >
  True Power of the Saiyan Race: You know beyond a shadow of a doubt that the classics are the best, and you rock those golden flames and green eyes with effortless swagger.
  (1)-[Passive]: Your stacks of Power are treated as if they are Battle Born stacks applied to your Wound Rolls for your effects (they do not count towards your maximum number of Battle Born).
  (2)-[Passive]: For each stack of Power you possess, increase your Wound Rolls by 1(T).
  (3)-[Passive]: While in a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect, double the increase to your Capacity from that Aspect.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you succeed at the Steadfast Check for a Health Threshold, you may use the Transformation Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver to attempt to enter a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect.

---

# (1) Your Power stacks read as Battle Born on the Wound for your effects (its header's `stacksCountAs`; amounts.mjs) - not toward its most.

# (2) Wound Rolls 1(T) a stack of Power.
[passive, effect 2]
wound += power.stacks * 1(T);

# (3) In a Transformation with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect: its Max Capacity increase doubled - 1/4 more.
[passive, effect 3]
if (aspectInUse("super-saiyan-form")) {
    capacity.maxFraction += 0.25;
}

# (4) A Steadfast Check passed, once an Encounter: the Transformation Maneuver out of sequence - into one with the Super Saiyan Form Aspect.
[triggered/steadfast-passed, 1/encounter, outOfSequence, effect 4]
transformationOutOfSequence();
